{"name":"Leanmaxxing","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":109,"casual":{"lead":["Leanmaxxing is the looksmaxxing term for lowering body fat so the jawline and cheekbones show and the face looks sharper. It is often the first step people take.","Losing body fat reduces facial fullness, which is widely observed, revealing the bone structure underneath. It is essentially a cutting phase, and the specific body-fat levels cited on forums come from anecdote; no published studies on facial leanness and attractiveness were found in the sources examined."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["People estimate maintenance calories, track intake and eat below it, adding cardio or lifting. Megathreads on looksmax.org offer calculators, tips and progress reports. Users discuss that going below roughly 15 percent body fat gets harder, and some mention appetite-control drugs or supplements."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Aggressive deficits can lead to muscle loss, low energy and hormonal effects, and posters include teenagers. Drug-assisted fat loss mentioned in forums carries the risks of those substances."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Leanmaxxing motivation","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-motivation.1649095/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251007165219/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-motivation.1649095/"},{"title":"Leanmaxxing vs muscle maxxing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-vs-muscle-maxxing.1509015/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250815192706/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-vs-muscle-maxxing.1509015/"},{"title":"Leanmaxxing Megathread","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-megathread.1490452/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250803220641/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-megathread.1490452/"},{"title":"lea