2608/"},{"title":"leanmaxxing is cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-cope.531172/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220714015135/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-cope.531172/"},{"title":"leanmaxxing is massively underrated","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-massively-underrated.512917/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220609034216/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-massively-underrated.512917/"},{"title":"leanmaxxing is so hard","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-so-hard.450663/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220514134822/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-so-hard.450663/"},{"title":"leanmaxxing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing.418883/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211203123829/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing.418883/"},{"title":"leanmaxxing is kind of a meme medium bf mogs for natties","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-kind-of-a-meme-medium-bf-mogs-for-natties.396153/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210923165509/https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-is-kind-of-a-meme-medium-bf-mogs-for-natties.396153/"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"The DevOps Diet (Getting Lean)","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=8163864","site":"Hacker News","score":1,"comments":0,"year":2014}],"web":[{"title":"Bodybuilding - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodybuilding"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Jawline & face shape","chain":["Lowering body fat","Less facial fat","Visible bone structure","Sharper jawline and face"],"effect":"indirect","text":"Leanmaxxing is often the first step in looksmaxxing: lose body fat to reveal cheekbones and the jawline. Fat loss reducing facial fullness is widely observed; the exact body-fat levels cited on forums come from anecdote."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Leanmaxxing is a looksmaxxing term for lowering body fat, with the aim of revealing facial bone structure and a leaner overall look. It is discussed on looksmax.org through many threads, including motivational posts, tips, guides and progress updates.[1][2][3]","The practice is essentially a cutting phase: users calculate daily energy needs, track calories and eat below maintenance. One long-running megathread directs readers to calorie calculators, tracking apps and a deficit below estimated maintenance, alongside encouragement to include cardio.[4]","Posters debate it against building muscle, for example asking whether a lean, light person or a heavier, stronger one looks better, and some say it becomes difficult below about 15 percent body fat.[5][6] Threads also mention drugs and supplements used for appetite control.[7]"],"infobox":[["Type","Looksmaxxing practice (fat loss)"],["Method","Calorie deficit, tracking, exercise"],["Goal","Reduce facial and body fat"],["Related","Cutting, mini-cut, recomp"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Leanmaxxing refers to reducing body fat in order to improve appearance, particularly facial definition.[1][5] Forum posts describe it as the first step many members take, and some frame it as a binary of getting lean or being left behind.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Practice","paras":["Community guides describe general fat-loss method: estimate body fat percentage, estimate daily energy expenditure, track food intake with an app, and eat below maintenance, with protein and vegetables often emphasised.[4] Specific guides in other threads cover strategies and effortless approaches.[8][9]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Relation to cutting and muscle","paras":["Bodybuilding sources describe cutting as eating below maintenance to lose fat while preserving muscle, noting that bigger deficits raise the risk of losing muscle.[10] Forum users ask whether leanness or muscularity improves appearance more.[5]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found on leanmaxxing as a practice. Wikipedia and general weight-loss literature discuss calorie deficits, but nothing examines facial leanness and perceived attractiveness in the sources used here."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Threads include progress posts, a field report involving a GLP-1 drug and a fibre supplement, and discussion of neck size.[6][7][11] Posts about drug-assisted fat loss describe what users report, not tested outcomes."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Leanmaxxing is regarded in many posts as a basic requirement for a defined face.[1][6]","claims":[{"claim":"Lower body fat makes the face more defined and attractive","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Getting below about 15 percent body fat is especially difficult","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Drugs such as GLP-1 agonists help leanmaxxing","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Leanmaxxing motivation","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-motivation.1649095/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"leanmaxxing tips","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-tips.1424195/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"leanmaxxing guide everything is a lie that you been told to","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-guide-everything-is-a-lie-that-you-been-told-to.1369055/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Leanmaxxing Megathread","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-megathread.1490452/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Leanmaxxing vs muscle maxxing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-vs-muscle-maxxing.1509015/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"leanmaxxing made me hit another pic bones poppin","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/leanmaxxing-made-me-hit-another-pic-bones-poppin.1298426/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"fo